WEBVTT

00:15.840 --> 00:20.740
I searched the village, 
but none of it makes any sense.

00:20.740 --> 00:24.620
The more I learn, 
the less clear things become.

00:25.810 --> 00:26.760
Gabimaru.

00:27.700 --> 00:29.180
Is something the matter?

00:29.180 --> 00:31.350
It's nothing. What were you saying?

00:31.350 --> 00:33.380
Well, Senta-dono says...

00:33.380 --> 00:35.700
His brain's about to explode.

00:35.700 --> 00:37.760
There are too many mysteries to solve.

00:37.760 --> 00:41.050
I need to cool my head and review the facts.

00:41.850 --> 00:44.420
Please rest, Senta-dono.

00:44.420 --> 00:46.500
I can keep watch by myself tonight.

00:46.500 --> 00:48.370
No, that's all right.

00:48.370 --> 00:50.560
I'll feel better once I've taken a bath.

00:50.560 --> 00:52.080
That will make you even sleepier.

00:52.080 --> 00:53.530
I'll be fine.

01:02.220 --> 01:03.910
There are too many mysteries.

01:04.520 --> 01:07.420
It's dangerous to act until we 
figure things out to some degree.

01:07.420 --> 01:09.540
How much is "some degree?"

01:09.540 --> 01:11.800
Well... I don't know.

01:11.800 --> 01:15.960
But if the Tensen guard the Elixir of Life,

01:15.960 --> 01:18.930
it'd be dangerous for us 
to enter Horai without a plan.

01:20.120 --> 01:22.610
<i>Sorry, but I don't have time to wait 
for you to solve those mysteries.</i>

01:23.180 --> 01:26.550
<i>If they're coming to meet us, 
then all the better.</i>

02:58.030 --> 03:02.530
<b>Gods and People</b>

03:00.320 --> 03:03.020
<i>The fog's so thick I can't see.</i>

03:03.780 --> 03:06.790
<i>We reached the village after traveling 
south through the woods from the beach.</i>

03:06.790 --> 03:08.720
<i>If Hoko is to be believed,</i>

03:08.720 --> 03:13.040
<i>I should approach Horai, 
the central region, if I continue south.</i>

03:23.680 --> 03:26.720
<i>What are these voices? Are they singing?</i>

03:28.150 --> 03:28.930
No...

03:35.790 --> 03:37.190
<i>They're chanting sutras?</i>

03:37.190 --> 03:38.900
<i>Are they more of Hoko's kind?</i>

03:39.220 --> 03:41.120
<i>They're not reacting to me approaching them.</i>

03:41.520 --> 03:43.200
<i>Are they immobile?</i>

03:45.390 --> 03:47.700
<i>They're praying to something?</i>

03:47.700 --> 03:51.210
It's dangerous to act until we 
figure things out to some degree.

03:51.700 --> 03:54.960
<i>Maybe that's how the Asaemon think, 
but condemned criminals are different.</i>

03:55.380 --> 03:58.240
<i>It's not like we'd turn back depending on 
what the island is actually like.</i>

03:58.240 --> 04:00.090
<i>This isn't that kind of expedition.</i>

04:01.880 --> 04:04.230
<i>No matter how dangerous 
we find this place to be,</i>

04:04.230 --> 04:07.130
<i>I won't be pardoned 
if I return without the elixir.</i>

04:07.130 --> 04:09.600
<i>Moving forward is my only option,</i>

04:09.910 --> 04:11.230
<i>even if I have to do it alone.</i>

04:15.400 --> 04:19.880
They say Horai is still 
as beautiful as ever.

04:20.360 --> 04:23.320
Unlike Hojo and Eishu, 
which have fallen into decay,

04:23.320 --> 04:28.040
it is the true Shinsenkyo 
where gods and hermits reside.

04:28.940 --> 04:31.170
The true Shinsenkyo?

04:31.870 --> 04:34.080
But this is clearly man-made.

04:36.090 --> 04:38.630
<i>If this place is Horai, 
then the Elixir must be...</i>

04:49.290 --> 04:51.640
<i>Who is this person? No...</i>

04:51.640 --> 04:55.390
<i>It looks human, but it's something else.</i>

04:56.660 --> 04:57.400
What are you?

04:57.400 --> 05:00.400
Ugh, this sucks.

05:00.400 --> 05:02.780
Why do they keep coming when it's my turn?

05:02.780 --> 05:04.530
What a pain.

05:04.530 --> 05:05.500
Okay...

05:05.500 --> 05:07.530
Would you mind leaving?

05:07.530 --> 05:10.030
I just fought some of you earlier.

05:10.360 --> 05:14.440
We're supposed to capture 
you humans when we find you.

05:14.960 --> 05:16.320
And today, I—

05:16.320 --> 05:19.840
So you can turn humans into the Elixir?

05:34.060 --> 05:34.850
Huh?

05:46.760 --> 05:50.820
<i>It can regenerate, and it's stronger 
and faster than its build suggests.</i>

05:50.820 --> 05:53.330
<i>Is this one of the...?</i>

06:00.530 --> 06:02.210
You broke my neck <i>again</i>.

06:02.630 --> 06:04.250
Ninpo: Ascetic Blaze.

06:28.090 --> 06:30.160
Oops, killed another one.

06:30.560 --> 06:34.410
He would've made good Elixir 
if I'd brought him back alive.

06:37.660 --> 06:39.160
It's a bit late to ask, but...

06:40.590 --> 06:42.540
are you a Tensen?

06:43.090 --> 06:45.800
Are you a human?

07:07.900 --> 07:10.900
Why are you so tough?

07:10.900 --> 07:14.040
I encountered a fairly 
tough human earlier, too.

07:14.040 --> 07:17.540
This is the first time I've seen 
someone like you in centuries.

07:18.850 --> 07:20.540
Where is the Elixir?

07:27.040 --> 07:30.210
<i>I should assume bludgeoning 
and slashing attacks are ineffective.</i>

07:32.930 --> 07:35.220
<i>Not only that, but it's 
exceptionally physically strong, too.</i>

07:36.180 --> 07:38.600
<i>Trading blows in a war 
of attrition would be dangerous.</i>

07:38.600 --> 07:40.980
<i>I need to come up with a plan of attack.</i>

07:41.250 --> 07:45.730
<i>It's immortal. Ascetic Blaze 
was ineffective.</i>

07:45.730 --> 07:47.310
<i>What other options do I have?</i>

07:48.230 --> 07:49.530
<i>What haven't I tried yet?</i>

07:53.950 --> 07:56.620
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

08:01.290 --> 08:05.000
<i>That reaction was clearly different 
from how it's responded until now.</i>

08:05.000 --> 08:07.630
<i>What was it? What worked?</i>

08:11.560 --> 08:13.130
<i>It's back to being a woman again.</i>

08:13.570 --> 08:15.600
Your physical capabilities...

08:15.600 --> 08:17.890
You probably don't realize it yourself, 
but you're probably...

08:19.570 --> 08:21.890
No, it doesn't matter.

08:32.150 --> 08:34.910
You're annoying. Die.

08:41.710 --> 08:44.000
<i>What is this?</i>

08:49.690 --> 08:51.670
<i>Wind pressure? No, that's not it.</i>

08:51.670 --> 08:54.430
<i>It feels like the blast 
is reverberating through my body.</i>

08:55.120 --> 08:57.300
<i>It's something else. Some unknown power.</i>

08:57.300 --> 09:00.310
<i>Guarding is pointless. I have to dodge—</i>

09:01.770 --> 09:04.240
<i>Is there any way to defeat this creature?</i>

09:08.160 --> 09:10.690
<i>No, I don't need a plan.</i>

09:10.690 --> 09:13.780
<i>No matter what, I can't stop moving.</i>

09:14.460 --> 09:16.530
<i>I need to get back to my wife.</i>

09:19.050 --> 09:21.450
<i>No matter what happens, 
I'll make it back alive.</i>

09:21.850 --> 09:24.580
<i>Even if my eyes and nose are torn 
from my face, I'll make it back alive.</i>

09:24.930 --> 09:26.670
<i>Even if I die, I'll make it back alive.</i>

09:29.590 --> 09:32.840
<i>If it can regenerate, then I'll
 destroy it faster than it can heal.</i>

09:37.870 --> 09:39.970
<i>Impossible. By a human?</i>

09:52.840 --> 09:54.840
I know you're not dead.

09:54.840 --> 09:57.360
Tell me. Where is the Elixir?

10:01.990 --> 10:03.670
What am I going to do?

10:05.620 --> 10:09.630
I'm going to get in trouble with them again.

10:42.960 --> 10:44.030
<i>Calm down.</i>

10:44.400 --> 10:47.340
<i>This isn't my first time fighting a monster.</i>

10:47.340 --> 10:49.220
<i>I just have to do what I've always done.</i>

10:49.220 --> 10:51.290
<i>Analyze and counter.</i>

10:51.690 --> 10:52.950
<i>If I can do that...</i>

11:36.420 --> 11:38.630
Ninpo: Ascetic Blaze.

11:41.180 --> 11:42.520
<i>My body...</i>

11:42.520 --> 11:45.550
<i>I'm finally paying for how 
hard I've been pushing myself.</i>

11:49.480 --> 11:52.310
<i>Strange spells, giant monsters...</i>

11:52.680 --> 11:55.100
<i>Is this the real world?</i>

11:55.770 --> 11:59.580
<i>No, have the events 
of the past few days even been real?</i>

12:00.700 --> 12:02.880
<i>It's like I'm in a nightmare.</i>

12:08.700 --> 12:10.240
You're awake.

12:12.960 --> 12:15.640
You were groaning in your sleep.

12:15.640 --> 12:17.960
Were you having unpleasant dreams?

12:18.840 --> 12:19.950
Yeah.

12:23.040 --> 12:26.410
I see. It was a dream.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.230
Good.

12:32.850 --> 12:36.340
So you were having a nightmare.

12:36.340 --> 12:39.180
You've been so busy lately.

12:39.180 --> 12:41.990
Why don't you rest today?

12:58.500 --> 13:00.240
This is chrysanthemum tea.

13:00.240 --> 13:03.060
I've heard it prevents nightmares.

13:07.010 --> 13:10.010
Oh, do you dislike chrysanthemum?

13:10.560 --> 13:14.020
No, I'm just really glad.

13:14.020 --> 13:18.520
Even if this is a dream, 
I'm glad I got to talk to you.

13:19.660 --> 13:21.530
What are you talking about?

13:24.200 --> 13:25.360
I'm sorry.

13:26.260 --> 13:29.200
I might not make it back home.

13:45.150 --> 13:48.420
<i>Shinobi Rule Number 20.</i>

13:48.890 --> 13:51.240
If you are facing death,

13:51.240 --> 13:53.480
then draw on whatever life you have left

13:53.480 --> 13:58.400
to deal as much damage as possible 
to the enemy before dying.

13:58.400 --> 14:00.350
<i>You don't have to bother 
remembering that one.</i>

14:00.350 --> 14:04.360
<i>I've trained you so 
you'll do it instinctively.</i>

14:08.530 --> 14:10.170
<i>On the brink of death,</i>

14:10.170 --> 14:12.700
<i>you'll reflexively attempt 
to take your opponent down with you,</i>

14:12.700 --> 14:15.040
<i>regardless of your own will.</i>

14:26.270 --> 14:29.390
<i>I'm sorry. I might...</i>

14:58.070 --> 15:01.420
Mei, what do you think you're doing?

15:10.840 --> 15:13.180
Well, we can't help what's already happened.

15:13.180 --> 15:15.310
I'm s-s-s-sorry!

15:15.310 --> 15:18.060
I looked for him right away,

15:18.060 --> 15:21.090
but the mist got thicker 
the farther I got from the village.

15:21.090 --> 15:23.030
It was a struggle getting back here.

15:23.030 --> 15:28.130
It's impossible for an ordinary person 
to make any real progress in that mist.

15:28.130 --> 15:32.820
If Gabimaru headed towards Horai, 
then we must search for him immediately.

15:32.820 --> 15:34.630
What? No thanks.

15:34.630 --> 15:35.330
What?

15:35.330 --> 15:38.330
I mean, we don't have time for that, right?

15:38.330 --> 15:41.090
Besides, he's the one who decided to go.

15:41.090 --> 15:44.910
He was an asset in combat, 
but it's not like we can help it now.

15:44.910 --> 15:49.970
Plus, it's not like the Asaemon care 
about the safety of the criminals, right?

15:49.970 --> 15:50.540
What?

15:50.540 --> 15:52.470
There's no reason to look for him.

15:52.470 --> 15:53.340
Actually—

15:53.340 --> 15:56.350
If you're going to Horai, 
I'll accompany you.

15:56.350 --> 16:02.120
I haven't seen Mei. 
She probably went after Gabimaru.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.980
I must look for her.

16:03.980 --> 16:05.950
I'd appreciate your help.

16:05.950 --> 16:09.210
Are you saying you can 
get there through the fog?

16:09.210 --> 16:10.490
It's possible.

16:12.990 --> 16:17.600
I'm actually starting to, 
y'know, worry about Gabimaru.

16:17.600 --> 16:19.620
Let's go, Sagirin.

16:20.770 --> 16:21.870
Okay.

16:21.870 --> 16:25.250
Anyway, even if we make it to Horai,

16:25.250 --> 16:28.440
those troublesome Tensen 
will be there, right?

16:28.440 --> 16:29.510
Yes.

16:29.510 --> 16:33.510
Who exactly are the Tensen? 
Tell us all about them.

16:33.510 --> 16:37.500
Yuzuriha-san, we'll get lost 
if we don't focus.

16:37.500 --> 16:38.860
We won't get lost.

16:38.860 --> 16:40.790
Aren't you curious too, Sagirin?

16:40.790 --> 16:41.520
What?

16:41.520 --> 16:43.080
About the Tensen.

16:43.520 --> 16:46.480
Yes, I suppose I am.

16:47.920 --> 16:52.970
If the Tensen reside in Horai, 
then we'll probably run into them somewhere.

16:53.530 --> 16:55.800
The Tensen...

16:56.280 --> 16:58.780
are seven hermits.

16:59.780 --> 17:01.540
I prefer being male.

17:01.540 --> 17:04.030
First, its construction is efficient.

17:04.030 --> 17:05.920
Utility is the essence of beauty.

17:05.920 --> 17:08.490
I definitely prefer being female.

17:08.490 --> 17:11.380
Just looking at women's bodies 
makes you want to touch them.

17:11.380 --> 17:12.840
Silence.

17:12.840 --> 17:15.430
Both are beautiful in their own way.

17:15.430 --> 17:17.800
Are we just talking about appearances?

17:17.800 --> 17:19.350
I prefer being male.

17:19.350 --> 17:21.850
The way this form feels and 
operates suits me better.

17:22.850 --> 17:25.760
What? But we screwed the other day as women...

17:25.760 --> 17:27.520
I was just curious.

17:27.520 --> 17:30.680
No way. You really seemed to enjoy yourself.

17:31.150 --> 17:34.850
I'm surprised you can 
tolerate someone so fussy.

17:34.850 --> 17:36.670
That's my favorite part.

17:36.670 --> 17:38.720
It is good to be energetic.

17:38.720 --> 17:40.490
Oh, shut up.

17:41.710 --> 17:45.650
Enough chit-chat. Let us make our reports.

17:46.960 --> 17:50.500
Some humans arrived several days ago.

17:50.500 --> 17:53.150
They seem different from previous humans.

17:53.150 --> 17:55.510
There aren't many of them, 
but they're fierce.

17:55.880 --> 17:58.090
Many Soshin have been killed.

17:58.090 --> 18:01.410
Zhu Jin, it's your fault 
for keeping watch so sloppily.

18:02.100 --> 18:05.150
You allowed the humans you 
found on the beach to escape.

18:05.150 --> 18:08.440
And last night, you struggled against 
another human you met in front of the gates.

18:08.440 --> 18:10.650
You're pathetic.

18:14.400 --> 18:18.160
Not only that, but judging by your appearance, 
you've been using too much Tao.

18:18.160 --> 18:20.200
Poor thing.

18:20.200 --> 18:22.160
You reap what you sow.

18:22.440 --> 18:26.290
I can't believe a human forced you 
to use your Kishikai transformation.

18:26.290 --> 18:27.950
Enough, Ju Fa.

18:27.950 --> 18:31.790
We're a family. A family sticks together.

18:31.790 --> 18:33.980
And a family also obeys.

18:33.980 --> 18:39.550
I'm the only one allowed to harm Zhu Jin.

18:41.410 --> 18:42.550
Fine.

18:42.550 --> 18:47.560
Did you deal with the humans you 
encountered in the woods properly?

18:47.560 --> 18:49.980
I brought them near death 
and threw them in the pit.

18:50.440 --> 18:52.310
They should be flowers by now.

18:52.640 --> 18:54.230
Don't underestimate them.

18:54.800 --> 18:57.410
The corpse of a Monshin 
was discovered as well.

18:57.410 --> 19:00.860
Anyone capable of killing them 
is no ordinary human.

19:00.860 --> 19:06.120
Between them and the human Zhu Jin cornered 
last night, something's different this time.

19:08.290 --> 19:10.700
If they make it out of the pit,

19:11.250 --> 19:13.880
you'll find injured beasts 
can be terrifying creatures.

19:13.880 --> 19:18.120
If the humans who arrived 
with them this time are just as capable,

19:18.120 --> 19:20.260
then this will be rather difficult.

19:21.930 --> 19:26.140
You killed the man who forced you to 
use your Kishikai transformation, didn't you?

19:27.250 --> 19:28.270
Yes.

19:30.170 --> 19:34.420
Well, no matter who comes our way, 
there's only one thing we want.

19:42.840 --> 19:44.780
To eternity and our revered master.

19:51.930 --> 19:54.720
There are seven immortal beings?

19:54.720 --> 19:57.670
They say that, originally, there was only one.

19:57.670 --> 19:59.420
What? What does that mean?

19:59.420 --> 20:04.290
Shangdi Samantabhadra, 
Dadi Aksho, Jiujun Amoghavajra,

20:04.290 --> 20:10.890
Sagacious Dasheng Ratna, Yuanjun Tathātā, 
Gonggong Manjusri, Deified Dijun Cundi...

20:10.890 --> 20:15.980
A hermit who mastered their art 
and became a god split into these seven parts.

20:15.980 --> 20:18.800
They all look and sound the same,

20:18.800 --> 20:21.160
but their personalities 
and roles are different.

20:21.160 --> 20:23.800
Together, the seven of them rule this island.

20:24.450 --> 20:28.240
But that is only a legend from 
when I was a child.

20:28.240 --> 20:31.960
A child? Like, back 
when you were just a leaf?

20:31.960 --> 20:36.130
No. I used to look like you.

20:36.710 --> 20:40.590
Everyone who lives 
on the island looked human once.

20:40.590 --> 20:44.100
They were longer-lived 
and more devout than your kind.

20:44.100 --> 20:46.720
The villages prospered.

20:46.720 --> 20:48.320
But...

20:50.930 --> 20:52.350
What is this?

20:52.350 --> 20:55.600
The villages only prospered 
until a thousand years ago.

20:56.050 --> 21:00.110
Though our lives are long, 
we transform before we die.

21:00.110 --> 21:01.360
Transform?

21:01.360 --> 21:04.630
Our bodies slowly become trees.

21:04.630 --> 21:09.800
Eventually we become a tree and 
take root in the land, praying cross-legged.

21:09.800 --> 21:12.510
The transformation progresses 
regardless of our age,

21:12.510 --> 21:14.250
and we lose awareness as well.

21:14.250 --> 21:17.920
Just before we lose our 
awareness, we gather here.

21:17.920 --> 21:22.720
It's said that by doing so, we ensure our 
souls are invited into Horai after death.

21:23.690 --> 21:26.300
My awareness is fading as well.

21:26.300 --> 21:29.220
I had a family, but they transformed.

21:29.220 --> 21:31.720
This is my daughter.

21:31.720 --> 21:36.230
Unfortunately, she was 
the first in our family to transform.

21:38.230 --> 21:44.490
No wonder your village fell 
into ruin, even after 1,000 years of prosperity.

21:44.490 --> 21:48.630
Horai is the final resting place of souls.

21:48.630 --> 21:52.550
The Tensen are gods 
that choose who will enter Horai.

21:52.550 --> 21:54.500
They mustn't be defied.

21:55.650 --> 21:57.810
<i>He chose to leave on his own,</i>

21:58.280 --> 22:00.810
<i>and the safety of the criminals 
doesn't fall under my jurisdiction.</i>

22:01.880 --> 22:02.760
<i>But...</i>

22:03.740 --> 22:05.410
<i>I hope he's all right.</i>

22:06.500 --> 22:09.120
<i>Where am I?</i>

22:09.120 --> 22:11.890
<i>Did this girl save me?</i>

22:14.320 --> 22:19.400
<i>They're neither hermits nor gods. 
They're true monsters.</i>

22:19.910 --> 22:24.080
<i>I'll have to defeat them 
to acquire the Elixir.</i>

22:25.470 --> 22:26.780
<i>Good.</i>

22:28.040 --> 22:32.410
<i>If they're monsters and not gods, 
then there must be a way to kill them.</i>

22:32.410 --> 22:34.380
<i>But I mustn't be reckless.</i>

22:34.380 --> 22:36.660
<i>I need to come up with a plan to fight them.</i>

22:36.660 --> 22:38.230
<i>It'll be difficult to do alone.</i>

22:38.230 --> 22:42.090
<i>With two, three, or even more...</i>

22:44.520 --> 22:49.340
I thought I'd found a moving rag, 
but you're that shinobi.

22:49.340 --> 22:52.600
You're looking ragged. 
Is it time for you to die?
